  "stem": "<p>Square A has side lengths that are <math alttext=\"166\"><mn>166</mn>\n</math> times the side lengths of square B. The area of square A is <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> times the area of square B. What is the value of <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
